termination of the SCSI bus at both ends.  The KZPBA should handle its own SCSI
termination.  What about the cable and the drive attached nearest to the end of
the cable?  Does the cable have a SCSI terminator attached to it?  Or does the
last drive provide SCSI bus termination?

