Sense key 0B:

ABORTED COMMAND. Indicates that the target
aborted the command. The initiator may be
able to recover by trying the command again.

The 48|00, if we assume that they are the ASC and ASCQ is:

Initiator detected error message received.

It's not unheard of to have a bad cable -- even if it's new.  

-- 

