I should have clarified that there's no actual RT-11 OS in the picture,
this is legacy support for (what I believe are) RX50 disks with an RT-11
file system, but running on PCs and Macs.  The format was established
many years ago when DEC systems were the primary suppliers and consumers
of these files, and it's just stuck around by inertia.

